<section id="why">
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2 class="rise">Why I made it free.</h2>
    <p class="lead rise">Cutting clips is a chore, and a chore should not cost a subscription.</p>
    <div class="reasons">
      <div class="reason rise"><b>Free and open source</b><p>The code is on GitHub under Apache 2.0. Read it, change it, build your own.</p></div>
      <div class="reason rise"><b>Nothing leaves your Mac</b><p>No account. No upload. Your clips are transcribed and cut on your own computer.</p></div>
      <div class="reason rise"><b>No subscription, no watermark</b><p>There's nothing to pay for, and nothing gets stamped on your video.</p></div>
      <div class="reason rise"><b>You post it yourself</b><p>You get a file that's ready for Reels and TikTok. The app never touches your accounts.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
